title Caravan endure -- a quarrel its holder still presses outlives the run that heard it
prompt Keaton asked for the next agent-doable lap, Lindy-first crux-first, on the running thread the last log's recommend named.
think The running thread is the Caravan correction arc, sixty-eight rungs deep. The appeal log's recommend named the crux exactly: the record holds a reader's pressing and every note of it is one run deep, so a plan run again tomorrow starts from a person whose position it has already forgotten.
think Standfast first. Every row in crux/REDS.md reads CLOSED -- %81, %84, %96, %97 among them -- so no red preempts constructive work this lap.
think The honest tension is written into the rung below's own provisioning, which clears plan.appeal on purpose: a record holding the last run's plea would hold a living person to what they said about a plan since run again. That defense is right, and it is the reason this rung is not simply carrying everything forward.
think The distinction that resolves it is one line. A reader who accepts has closed their own quarrel, and that contentment answers for the run that earned it and nothing after. A reader who presses has said the opposite, and a position stated that way stands until its holder says otherwise. Carrying the first is presumption; dropping the second is forgetting.
think The rung is endure, drawn by the Comlink tendency -- the clear warm word, colliding with nothing in the 74-module roster.
think The act is one byte into caravan/.endures/plan.standing, and it is the only note of this whole arc a provisioning leaves alone. Every other note here clears so no run wears another's findings; this one survives so no run opens blind to a quarrel still live.
think A position is quoted and never composed, the same restraint the three rungs below keep: no run writes a reader's plea, and no run drops a standing one. clear_standing opens a fresh tree, and the selftest harness calls it standing in for one, by name.
think The build is a delegating layer, as every rung of this arc is. The appeal layer became a delegation block, the report accessors each deepened one tier, a new appeal_of joined at the shallowest, and the new layer added its enum, its byte, its two counts, its four refusals, and its one measurement.
think The lap is one plan run twice under the same appeal word, parted only by the endurance word, and a third run whose reader accepts -- which carries nothing of its own and leaves the position pressed two runs earlier standing.
obs The property this rung claims is the first in the arc no single run can show from inside itself: the byte survives a provisioning. So it earned its own fold, where the note is written, a provisioning runs over it, plan.appeal comes back cleared and plan.standing comes back unchanged.
obs The wire's final reading is the proof in miniature: plan.standing reads p from the second run while plan.appeal beside it reads a from the third. A position outlives the run that heard it; a plea does not.
obs The five RED paths were proven on metal before the claim. Publish a position the reader never wrote and the run refuses EndureMisremembered. Count one position twice and it refuses EndureMiscounted. Carry a contentment forward and it refuses EndureUnpressed. Carry a position where nobody was read and it refuses EndureEarly.
obs Two honest intermediate findings. Reaching EndureUnpressed on the wire took disarming the honest count first, because the fold catches it before the run can -- which is the fold doing its job. Reaching EndureEarly took disarming the count invariant and the heard-nobody invariant, the same shape the repose and appeal rungs reported.
obs The planted control is the one worth naming. With the note never written, the read-back skipped, the wire fold's survival read, and both harness reads gone, the selftest printed GREEN while caravan/.endures/plan.standing did not exist at all -- the next run opening on a reader whose position was forgotten, and the run saying otherwise. Seeing that once is what makes the reading back a check rather than decoration.
obs The touch opened the 70-line ratchet in the fold check, so it split twice at its own seams: what a position is and how the count closes on it, what a run is refused when it reaches for one it may not carry, and the number the rung moves. Every new function stands at 57 lines or fewer.
obs Registered in the choir the same round, per REDS %81's lesson -- a rung that lands as its own green witness and never joins the suite is a loom firing unheard. caravan/.endures joined the ignore roster beside its siblings.
obs The council rota doc this lap was item 15, TAME_CORE with the Guidance shelf beside it, taken as choir count 69 mod 27. Its root rule 2 -- assert invariants first, aim two per function, state them positively -- shaped every invariant in the new layer, and its Rye reflex on short functions is why the fold check split rather than stood at 130.
loom witness=caravan_endure_witness result=GREEN rungs_sung=69 phases=6 dependents=6 absorbed=3 lost=3 reseated=3 carried_forward=1 dropped_spent=1 dropped_kept=0
loom witness=caravan_suite_witness result=GREEN registered=69 on_disk=69
file caravan/endure.rye the rung itself -- the endure layer over the appeal rung, delegating whole and adding one note a provisioning leaves alone
file tools/caravan_endure_witness.rish the witness on metal -- the fold, the survival past a provisioning, the three-run lap, and every note read outside the run that wrote it
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish registers the new rung so the choir sings 69 in one voice
file caravan/README.md the durable record of the rung, in the arc's own table and its own section
file .gitignore caravan/.endures joins the ignore roster beside its siblings
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live card names this edge and folds the one below it to a pointer
recommend keep-going the arc now corrects a record, carries the correction where it is read, hears the answer, records the disagreement, escorts the word, bounds the objection, stands its standing in the mark, tells the raiser how it came out, reads what they say back, and carries a live quarrel past the run that heard it -- so the question above it is what a run owes a position it inherits: the next run opens knowing somebody presses still, and nothing yet obliges it to do anything about that, which means a quarrel can stand forever in a note every run reads and no run answers.
